As shipped from the OSF, the man command (in OSF/1 release 1.0.4) had
'-Tlp' in its nroff command.

I would guess that DEC changed it to be vt100 since 'everyone' has 
DEC terminals hooked up or xterms.  [note everyone in quotes before flaming]

