: 	Fatal error in: /usr/lib/cmplrs/cc/umerge Segmentation fault

Try compiling using the -c option and use ld with a -O of less than 2
for the final link. The -O option is also passed to ld, which will seg fault
on large programs if it is larger that -O1. The difference in speed for
the executable using -O1 instead of -O2 ends up being negligible. The bug 
in ld has been reported to DEC engineering. 
